      "* Outputs \"CHANGED:<value>\" to stdout when the text changes.",
      "* Exits after a timeout or on receiving a termination signal.",
      "*",
      "* Protocol (stdout):",
      "*   INITIAL_VALUE:<text>  - Initial text field value",
